      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## Enterprise Dual-Signal B2B Pipeline (Zero-Proxy)\n\n### What this workflow automates\n1. **Dual High-Intent Sourcing:** Pulls live **Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby** `SOC 2` & `RevOps` hiring triggers (`Apify #5`) alongside **`$1M+` SEC Form D** funded operating startups (`Apify #3`, auto-filtering ~76% fund/REIT noise).\n2. **Deduplication Gate:** Checks against `Processed_Domains` in Google Sheets so repeat domains never trigger duplicate outreach.\n3. **Live Security & Stack Audit:** Runs Google DoH (`MX / SPF / DMARC`), port-443 TLS expiry, and tech-stack detection (`Apify #2`) on verified HTTP `200–399` websites.\n4. **Urgency Routing + AI Draft:** Routes `CRITICAL`, `MEDIUM`, and `LOW` leads via Switch; generates human-reviewed **Gmail Drafts** via OpenAI + posts `CRITICAL` Slack alerts."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ent-note-02-setup",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Steps",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        320,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 440,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## Setup Requirements\n\n- **Header Auth Credential (`Apify Bearer`):** Create one Generic Header Auth credential (`Name: Authorization`, `Value: Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`) and attach it to all 3 Apify HTTP Request nodes.\n- **Google Sheets:** Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in both Sheets nodes (using the `Processed_Domains` tab so logged audits automatically populate the deduplication ledger for subsequent runs). Leave `Continue On Fail` enabled on the read node so an empty first-run sheet does not halt execution.\n- **OpenAI + Gmail + Slack:** Connect OpenAI API credentials on `OpenAI Chat Model`, Gmail OAuth2 on `Save Outreach as Gmail Draft` (creates reviewable drafts—no auto-blasting), and Slack credentials + `YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID`."
      }
    },
    {
