        "content": "## Deduplication & Zero-Browser Audit\n\nMerges hiring-intent and funding signals, removes any domain already logged in `Processed_Domains`, and audits only net-new live domains via Google DoH + port-443 TLS handshake (`256 MB` RAM, zero residential proxies)."
