        "text": "=Write a concise, non-salesy 4-sentence technical observation note to the decision maker at {{ $json.company_name }} ({{ $json.domain }}).\nContext:\n- Signal: {{ $json.upstream_source }} — {{ $json.signal_detail }}\n- Decision Maker: {{ $json.decision_maker }}\n- Mail Gateway: {{ $json.cold_email_mx_provider }}\n- DMARC Policy: {{ $json.dmarc_policy }} | SPF: {{ $json.spf_strictness }} | SSL Days Left: {{ $json.ssl_days_remaining }}\n- Tech Stack: {{ $json.detected_tech_stack }}\n- Security Finding: {{ $json.msp_security_hook }}\n\nRules: Plain text only, zero hype words, mention the exact DMARC/SPF or hiring finding in sentence 1, and ask one direct question."
